OL,4,G2100FAsian Network Certified: MR.O
OL,5,     GMR.O jumps on the decks to bring
OL,6,     Gthe energy to Friday nights!
OL,7,G0000FDesi Dancefloor Mix
OL,8,     GAiks is stepping into the Desi
OL,9,     GDancefloor Mix from London and
OL,10,     Gdropping big sounds.
OL,11,G0030FDesi Dancefloor Mix
OL,12,     GRamnik is stepping into the Desi
OL,13,     GDancefloor Mix and bringing the
OL,14,     GUKG and Panjabi heat from Slough!
OL,15,G0100FPure Spice with DJ Manara
OL,16,     GManara's back with three hours of
OL,17,     Gbouncy club tunes, immortal
OL,18,     Gthrowbacks and dance music to
OL,19,     Gmake you FEEL. Plus Manara's on a
OL,20,     Ghousey tip for this week's Shades
OL,21,     GOn mix. Contains strong language.
